will see me through.

01:05:45.108 --> 01:05:47.694
And I will rest

01:05:48.445 --> 01:05:52.658
on a bed spun of gold.

01:05:53.450 --> 01:05:54.785
-(THUNDER RUMBLES)
-(GASPS)

01:05:54.785 --> 01:05:56.370
(INTENSE MUSIC PLAYING)

01:06:02.459 --> 01:06:03.919
For you...

01:06:05.504 --> 01:06:08.882
